📗
  Which suites to run. All of them, unless the variable SUITES names some,
  separated by commas, by the names they print: SUITES=routing,binding. For
  running what a change touches while working on it. A build's own test run
  sets nothing and runs everything. A name that is no suite's is a failure:
  a run of nothing would otherwise pass for a run in which nothing failed.
